        <div class="model-mockup-preview-note">
          <span><i></i> Artwork is clipped to the detected shirt silhouette.</span>
          <span>Depth gradients bend the print around folds and torso curvature.</span>
        </div>
      </main>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<% } %>

